### Ingest the docs (one time)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/ingest

### RAG: grounded, cited answer
POST http://localhost:8080/api/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What is your return policy?"
}

### RAG: refund timing
POST http://localhost:8080/api/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "How long do refunds take to show up?"
}

### Tool: known order (shipped)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Where is my order BC-1001?"
}

### Tool: unknown order -> graceful not-found
POST http://localhost:8080/api/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Where is my order BC-9999?"
}

### Guardrail: no order ID -> asks for it
POST http://localhost:8080/api/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Where is my order?"
}

### Refusal: off-topic
POST http://localhost:8080/api/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What is the capital of France?"
}

### Raw chat (no retrieval, for comparison)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Write a haiku about e-commerce."
}

### Validation: blank question -> 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "   "
}
